# Architecture source of truth

When designing or implementing features for public sharing, user profiles, or routing:

- Read and follow [docs/architecture.md](../../docs/architecture.md) before making structural decisions.
- Module specs live in [docs/modules/](../../docs/modules/).
- Implementation plans live in [.cursor/plans/](../plans/).

Do not contradict the data model, routing table, or module boundaries in `architecture.md` without updating that document first.
